    "body": "## Summary\n- Extract `BLELinkStateStore` to own BLE central/peripheral link maps, direct-link lookups, snapshots, and cleanup.\n- Route `BLEService` connect, disconnect, restore, send, notification, and central subscription paths through the store instead of mutating link dictionaries directly.\n- Add focused store coverage for central bindings, multi-link lookup, and central cleanup.\n\n## Impact\n- Keeps this stacked on #1306 while shrinking `BLEService.swift` by 98 lines.\n- Narrows BLE link ownership so the remaining transport refactor has a cleaner boundary for connection state and fanout decisions.\n\n## Validation\n- `git diff --check`\n- `xcodebuild -project bitchat.xcodeproj -scheme \"bitchat (iOS)\" -sdk iphonesimulator -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17' test -only-testing:bitchatTests_iOS/BLELinkStateStoreTests`\n- `xcodebuild -project bitchat.xcodeproj -scheme \"bitchat (iOS)\" -sdk iphonesimulator -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17' test`\n- `xcodebuild -project bitchat.xcodeproj -scheme \"bitchat (macOS)\" -configuration Debug CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO build`",
