    "body": "## Summary\n- Extract BLE outbound fragment transfer slot, queue, cancellation, and progress bookkeeping into `BLEOutboundFragmentTransferScheduler`\n- Move pending Noise private-message and typed-payload state into `BLENoiseSessionQueues`\n- Centralize private message, receipt, delivered-ack, and opaque typed Noise payload construction in `BLENoisePayloadFactory`\n- Keep `BLEService` focused on packet serialization and dispatch with a single encrypted Noise packet helper\n- Extract outbound packet padding, message IDs, write priority, and MTU fragment chunk policy into `BLEOutboundPacketPolicy`\n- Extract incoming media persistence and quota enforcement into `BLEIncomingFileStore`, reducing `BLEService` to 4,148 lines; `BLEService` itself is 359 lines smaller across this PR while the new helpers isolate the moved behavior\n- Snapshot direct peripheral and subscribed-central link state once per BLE send path, reducing duplicate BLE queue reads and central-list snapshots in `sendEncrypted` and `sendOnAllLinks`\n- Canonicalize Nostr relay URLs so `wss://relay.example` and `wss://relay.example:443/` share one socket/subscription target, reducing duplicate geo-relay event fanout seen in Mac logs\n- Treat delivered ACKs that arrive after read receipts as stale lower-rank updates in logs instead of unknown-message warnings\n- Redact BLE message content from transport logs while retaining IDs, sizes, and routing context for debugging\n- Harden app CI by isolating image processing test output and giving the async read-receipt queue test realistic runner headroom\n- Apply BLE delivered/read receipts by message ID through the delivery coordinator so early receipts update visible private chats and the conversation store\n- Include the Codex review follow-up from the base stack: self-authored RSR/TTL-0 sync responses are allowed through ingress while ordinary self-loopbacks still drop\n\n## Validation\n- `git diff --check`\n- `swift test --parallel --quiet --package-path . --filter 'ImageUtilsTests|NostrTransportTests/readReceiptQueueThrottlesSequentially|BLEOutboundFragmentTransferSchedulerTests'`\n- `swift test --parallel --quiet --package-path . --filter 'BLEServiceCoreTests|BLEOutboundWriteBufferTests|BLEOutboundFragmentTransferSchedulerTests|BLEIngressLinkRegistryTests'`\n- `swift test --parallel --quiet --package-path . --filter 'GeoRelayDirectoryTests|NostrRelayManagerTests|ChatViewModelNoisePayloadTests|ChatViewModelDeliveryStatusTests'`\n- `swift test --parallel --quiet --package-path .`\n- `xcodebuild -project bitchat.xcodeproj -scheme \"bitchat (iOS)\" -sdk iphonesimulator -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17' test -only-testing:bitchatTests_iOS/ChatViewModelNoisePayloadTests -only-testing:bitchatTests_iOS/ChatViewModelDeliveryStatusTests`\n- `xcodebuild -project bitchat.xcodeproj -scheme \"bitchat (iOS)\" -sdk iphonesimulator -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17' test -only-testing:bitchatTests_iOS/BLEIngressLinkRegistryTests -only-testing:bitchatTests_iOS/BLEServiceCoreTests -only-testing:bitchatTests_iOS/RequestSyncManagerTests -only-testing:bitchatTests_iOS/GossipSyncManagerTests`\n- `xcodebuild -project bitchat.xcodeproj -scheme \"bitchat (macOS)\" -configuration Debug CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO build`\n- `xcodebuild -project bitchat.xcodeproj -scheme \"bitchat (iOS)\" -sdk iphonesimulator -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17' test`\n- GitHub Actions #1306 `Build & Test` passed on `b535f0f6`.\n\n## Notes\n- Stacked on `codex/ble-ingress-link-registry` for an incremental BLE architecture review.",
