    "body": "## Summary\n- Extract BLE ingress duplicate/last-hop tracking into `BLEIngressLinkRegistry`.\n- Extract outbound BLE fanout selection into `BLEFanoutSelector`.\n- Track the ingress peer as well as the physical link so dual-role connections do not echo packets back to the peer that supplied them.\n- Stop relaying packets once this device is the directed recipient, preventing consumed Noise handshakes/DMs from being flooded onward.\n- Carry the RSR/TTL-0 self-authored sync-response exception into the extracted ingress registry.\n- Backport read-receipt queue test timing hardening so the middle stack PR uses the same CI-stable assertion as the top branch.\n\n## Why\nPhone logs showed public chat and DMs working, but also a burst of self-loopback drops for type 16/17 packets after direct traffic. The new ingress guard was correctly dropping them, but the relay path could still send phone-origin packets back over the phone's alternate BLE role. This moves the hot-path policy into tested units and suppresses that avoidable relay traffic.\n\n## Validation\n- `xcodebuild -project bitchat.xcodeproj -scheme \"bitchat (macOS)\" -configuration Debug CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO build`\n- `xcodebuild test -scheme \"bitchat (iOS)\" -project bitchat.xcodeproj -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17' -only-testing:bitchatTests_iOS/BLEIngressLinkRegistryTests`\n- `xcodebuild test -scheme \"bitchat (iOS)\" -project bitchat.xcodeproj -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17' -only-testing:bitchatTests_iOS/BLEFanoutSelectorTests`\n- `xcodebuild test -scheme \"bitchat (iOS)\" -project bitchat.xcodeproj -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17' -only-testing:bitchatTests_iOS/RelayControllerTests`\n- `xcodebuild test -scheme \"bitchat (iOS)\" -project bitchat.xcodeproj -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17' -only-testing:bitchatTests_iOS/BLEServiceCoreTests`\n- `xcodebuild -project bitchat.xcodeproj -scheme \"bitchat (iOS)\" -sdk iphonesimulator -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17' test -only-testing:bitchatTests_iOS/BLEIngressLinkRegistryTests -only-testing:bitchatTests_iOS/BLEServiceCoreTests -only-testing:bitchatTests_iOS/RequestSyncManagerTests -only-testing:bitchatTests_iOS/GossipSyncManagerTests`\n- `swift test --parallel --quiet --package-path . --filter 'NostrTransportTests/readReceiptQueueThrottlesSequentially'`\n- `swift test --parallel --quiet --package-path .`\n- `xcodebuild -project bitchat.xcodeproj -scheme \"bitchat (iOS)\" -sdk iphonesimulator -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17' test`\n- GitHub Actions #1280 `Build & Test` passed on `6bce2b4d`.",
